{"ID":"20260624164226-ohmpj4r","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-ohmpj4r","title":"系统技术规格","type":"doc","updated":"20260626141954"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260624164226-98ovr4d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-98ovr4d","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系统技术规格"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-4lzzxr9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-4lzzxr9","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第0章: 文档约定"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-q2jmfo3","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 策划案描述 | UE5 对应 | 说明 |\n|-----------|----------|------|\n| 玩家主界面 (\\*1\\*) | `L_MainMenu`（独立关卡） | 纯UMG界面，无3D场景 |\n| 玩家玩的以B为主角的游戏 (\\*2\\*) | `L_BGameplay`（持久关卡） | 3D第一人称，主游戏场景 |\n| B玩的游戏主界面 (\\*3\\*) | `WBP_ConsoleUI`（UMG Widget） | 覆盖在L2之上的UI层 |\n| B玩的以A为主角的游戏 (\\*4\\*) | `L_AGameplay`（子关卡或RenderTarget） | 嵌套游戏内容，暂缓设计 |\n| 拿出/收起游戏机 | 游戏机组件状态切换 | L2↔L3的触发动作 |\n| 存档 | SaveGame 对象 | 持久化数据容器 |\n| 旧存档 | 带锁定标记的存档槽 | 初始存在，通关前不可操作 |\n| 游魂 | 敌人AI | 追踪玩家的不可见敌人 |\n| 夺舍 | 叙事事件触发 + 存档删除检测 | 核心剧情机制 |\n| 元气/精力 | float 变量 0~1 | 影响移动速度、画面后处理 |\n| 契印 | NarrativeFlag 中的一个标记 | 剧情关键标记 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-q2jmfo3","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"策划案描述"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UE5 对应"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说明"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家主界面 ("},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"L_MainMenu"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（独立关卡）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纯UMG界面，无3D场景"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家玩的以B为主角的游戏 ("},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"L_BGameplay"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（持久关卡）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3D第一人称，主游戏场景"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B玩的游戏主界面 ("},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WBP_ConsoleUI"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（UMG Widget）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"覆盖在L2之上的UI层"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B玩的以A为主角的游戏 ("},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"L_AGameplay"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（子关卡或RenderTa