-----|---------|\n| `Noise_Footstep_Walk` | 500 | 玩家走路 |\n| `Noise_Footstep_Run` | 1200 | 玩家跑步 |\n| `Noise_DoorOpen` | 2000 | 开门 |\n| `Noise_ObjectDrop` | 1500 | 物体掉落 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-u3iq7l0","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"噪音标签"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"范围"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发场景"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Noise_Footstep_Walk"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"500"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家走路"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Noise_Footstep_Run"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1200"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家跑步"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Noise_DoorOpen"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2000"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开门"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Noise_ObjectDrop"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1500"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物体掉落"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-vemxqh2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-vemxqh2","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.3 Behavior Tree 结构"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-02fkesb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-02fkesb","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Root (Selector)\n│\n├── [Sequence] ▸ Chase (追赶) — 优先级最高\n│   ├── Decorator: HasLineOfSight?\n│   ├── Task: UpdateLastKnownLocation\n│   ├── Task: MoveDirectlyToward (全速)\n│   └── Task: PlayChaseAudio\n│\n├── [Sequence] ▸ Investigate (调查)\n│   ├── Decorator: HasLastKnownLocation OR HasHeardNoise?\n│   ├── Task: MoveToLastKnownLocation\n│   ├── Task: Rotate to Face Last Location (随机巡视)\n│   └── Wait: 3~8 秒\n│\n├── [Sequence] ▸ Stalk (尾随/制造恐怖)\n│   ├── Decorator: NOT PlayerIsAware\n│   ├── Decorator: Distance \u003e 800\n│   ├── Task: MoveNearPlayer (保持距离, 避开视线)\n│   └── Task: TriggerAmbientEvent (播放响声/挪动物体)\n│\n└── [Sequence] ▸ Patrol / Idle\n    ├── Task: GetNextPatrolPoint\n    └── Task: MoveToPatrolPoint\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-y0eagwx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-y0eagwx","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.4 关键约束"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-a75o9w7","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 约束 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **单AI** | 只存在一个敌人实例 |\n| **不可见** | Mesh = None，依赖3D音频提示位置 |\n| **追上了不GameOver** | 触发昏倒→苏醒流程（游魂暂归机制） |\n| **剧本干预** | 蓝图接口：`ForceSetAIState(NewState)` |\n| **随叙事变化** | AI 监听 `OnNarrativeFlagSet`，行为随进度改变 |\n| **Console激活时** | AI 继续运行但可降低 Tick 频率（Set Actor Tick Interval = 0.2s） |","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-a75o9w7","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"约束"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说明"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"单AI"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只存在一个敌人实例"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不可见"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mesh = None，依赖3D音频提示位置"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"追上了不GameOver"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发昏倒→苏醒流程（游魂暂归机制）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"剧本干预"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝图接口："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ForceSetAIState(NewState)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"随叙事变化"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 监听 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"OnNarrativeFlagSet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，行为随进度改变"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Console激活时"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 继续运行但可降低 Tick 频率（Set Actor Tick Interval = 0.2s）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-8k85egb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-8k85egb","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.5 昏倒/苏醒机制"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-7fito52","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-7fito52","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"被敌人追上:\n  1. 播放贴脸惊吓音效 + 屏幕淡黑\n  2. 切换到 SUBSTATE_STUNNED\n  3. 等待 N 秒（可配置变量，建议 3~5 秒）\n  4. 屏幕渐亮，玩家在附近安全位置醒来\n  5. SoulFragmentationLevel 临时回退\n  6. 广播 OnWakeUp (Event Dispatcher)\n  7. 切换到 SUBSTATE_NORMAL\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-b49ze9g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-b49ze9g","updated":"20260624164226"}},{"ID":"20260624164226-qdmehc4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-qdmehc4","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第7章: 运动系统 — "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sky 负责"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-edekhmo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-edekhmo","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.1 角色蓝图设计"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-jt02qrq","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-jt02qrq","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"BP_PlayerCharacterB (父类: Character)\n├── CameraComponent               — 第一人称，挂在头部\n├── CharacterMovementComponent\n│   ├── MaxWalkSpeed: 600 (默认，可蓝图修改)\n│   ├── MaxAcceleration: 2048\n│   └── bOrientRotationToMovement: false (鼠标控制朝向)\n├── (组件) 游戏机控制\n└── (组件) 交互检测\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-9r2jz2v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-9r2jz2v","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.2 暴露给蓝图的配置变量"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-hr7kmr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-hr7kmr6","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"BP_PlayerCharacterB"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中创建以下变量（勾选 Instance Editable 和 Expose on Spawn）："}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-b11yncc","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 变量名 | 类型 | 默认值 | 用途 |\n|--------|------|--------|------|\n| `WalkSpeed` | Float | 600.0 | 走路速度 |\n| `MouseSensitivity` | Float | 1.0 | 鼠标灵敏度 |\n| `FatigueSpeedMultiplier` | Float | 0.6 | 疲惫时的速度倍率 |\n| `bMovementEnabled` | Boolean | True | 移动是否可用（只读） |\n| `MovementLockCount` | Integer | 0 | 移动锁定引用计数 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-b11yncc","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量名"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"类型"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"默认值"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用途"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WalkSpeed"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Float"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"600.0"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"走路速度"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MouseSensitivity"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Float"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.0"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鼠标灵敏度"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FatigueSpeedMultiplier"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Float"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.6"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疲惫时的速度倍率"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bMovementEnabled"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Boolean"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"True"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动是否可用（只读）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MovementLockCount"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Integer"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动锁定引用计数"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-aarccic","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-aarccic","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.3 蓝图函数接口"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-hj1sjwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-hj1sjwk","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"BP_PlayerCharacterB"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中创建以下函数："}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-lotagwb","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 函数名 | 输入 | 输出 | 逻辑 |\n|--------|------|------|------|\n| `DisableMovement` | — | — | MovementLockCount += 1；若 \u003e0，Set Movement Mode = None |\n| `EnableMovement` | — | — | MovementLockCount -= 1；若 =0，Set Movement Mode = Walking |\n| `SetSpeedMultiplier` | Multiplier (Float) | — | MaxWalkSpeed = WalkSpeed × Multiplier |\n| `IsMovementEnabled` | — | Boolean | 返回 MovementLockCount == 0 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-lotagwb","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数名"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逻辑"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"DisableMovement"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MovementLockCount += 1；若 \u003e0，Set Movement Mode = None"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"EnableMovement"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MovementLockCount -= 1；若 =0，Set Movement Mode = Walking"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SetSpeedMultiplier"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Multiplier (Float)"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MaxWalkSpeed = WalkSpeed × Multiplier"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"IsMovementEnabled"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Boolean"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回 MovementLockCount == 0"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-o1axvh3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-o1axvh3","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260624164226-jl4o7mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-jl4o7mz","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"重要"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": DisableMovement/EnableMovement 使用引用计数（MovementLockCount），防止模块A禁用后被模块B误启用。仅在计数归零时真正恢复移动。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-poszo4e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-poszo4e","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.4 特殊状态联动"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-8paw8b7","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 条件 | 效果 | 蓝图实现 |\n|------|------|---------