26"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"场景: GameInstance 广播层级切换、存档事件\n实现:\n  1. 在 BP_HorrorGameInstance 中创建 Event Dispatcher\n  2. 发送方: Call [DispatcherName]\n  3. 接收方: Bind Event to [DispatcherName] (在 BeginPlay 中)\n  4. 接收方: Unbind (在 EndPlay 中)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-h035jn4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-h035jn4","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B.3 直接函数调用"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-e3jfvlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-e3jfvlm","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用途"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": 明确的一对一通信，调用方持有目标引用。"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-ti7vwo6","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-ti7vwo6","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"场景: PlayerController 调用 PlayerCharacter 的函数\n实现:\n  1. Get Player Character → Cast To BP_PlayerCharacterB\n  2. → Call DisableMovement / EnableMovement / SetSpeedMultiplier\n\n注意: 仅在已持有明确引用时使用，避免在 Tick 中频繁 Cast\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-czk653y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260624164226-czk653y","updated":"20260624164226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B.4 GameInstance 中转"}]},{"ID":"20260624164226-6hank6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"2